# HELP 比对  2026-11-20  S6a(evidence/split-s6a-board.log) vs S9c(evidence/split-s9c-oled.log)
S6a 行数=15  S9c 行数=15
## S6a 原文
 1. HELP HELP=list commands
 2. HELP PING=reply PONG
 3. HELP STAT=clk/up/tick/keys/uart counters
 4. HELP I2C=scan I2C1 bus, list 8-bit addresses
 5. HELP AHT=read AHT20, rh and t in 0.1 units
 6. HELP AHTS=same but read via repeated START
 7. HELP DIST=disabled, TIM2 given to motor
 8. HELP ADC=pot PA5 and NTC PA4, raw and mV
 9. HELP OLED=on/off/clear/test/show/frame/col/live/dump
10. HELP PWM=servo 0..180 deg, buzzer 100..5000 Hz, sweep
11. HELP TRACK=raw level of PB14 line sensor
12. HELP ENC=count/clear, dir, a/b, button PB15
13. HELP RELAY=on/off/stat, PB5 relay coil
14. HELP MOTOR=fwd/rev/stop/duty/stat, PA0/PA1 TIM2 PWM
15. HELP KEYS=key press counters, clears them
